   Pleiades Astrophoto, \e {MultiscaleGradientCorrection --- Dual-Band OSC
   Images (II)}, PixInsight YouTube channel,
   \xref {https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZYP7niz2hKU} {https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZYP7niz2hKU}
}

\make
